# Secure GenAI Student Support System

## 📖 Overview
This project is a Secure Generative AI-based Student Support System designed to assist students with academic queries while ensuring safety, privacy, and controlled responses.

The system integrates LLMs with guardrails, retrieval mechanisms, and modular agent-based architecture to provide accurate and secure responses.

---

## 🚀 Features
- 🔐 Secure AI responses with guardrails
- 🤖 LLM-powered student query handling
- 📚 Retrieval-based knowledge system
- 🧠 Agent-based modular design
- 📊 Streamlit-based interactive UI

